Cultural competence. Say it with me. Cultural competence!

10
00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:05.469
Collaboration. Say it with me. Collaboration!

11
00:01:08.951 --> 00:01:12.734
Belonging. Say it with me. Belonging!

12
00:01:16.247 --> 00:01:20.630
