Your turn. Say it with me. We are committed to reducing bias and building belonging.

17
00:02:00.926 --> 00:02:13.930
True inclusion goes beyond representation — it requires equity and reducing bias. Cultural competence and fair hiring build genuine collaboration and a sense of belonging.

18
