Bias!

21
00:02:24.153 --> 00:02:29.525
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:29.575 --> 00:02:30.725
Belonging!

23
00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:39.950
Think and answer. Why does diversity matter in the workplace?

24
